        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Ornate Collection Leverset Number OMN-572/00</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor more than 40 years, Omnia's line of products are designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sophisticated look is desired. Every piece is strong and durable, made from premium grade material and coupled with interior components that prove worthy of Omnia's exceptional standards. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever length: 5\". Projection: 2 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit 2 1/8\" bore</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use</li>\r\n<li>2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Construction</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose 2 5/8\" covers 2 1/8\" hole.</li>\r\n<li>All Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tubular Latch Specs</li>\r\n<li>All dimensions are standard to fit existing bores for easy replacement installations.</li>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>Critical interior parts are made of brass</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhen choosing a function:\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Double (Pair) Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
